  "system": {
    "identifier": "titanbound_graveward",
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4442\">GRAVEWARD</h2><p data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4476\"><em data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4476\">“No. Not yet. Try again later.”</em></p><p data-start=\"4499\" data-end=\"4550\">Gravewards do not heal.<br data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4525\" />They do not restore life.</p><p data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4586\">They <strong data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4585\">refuse to schedule death</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4677\">Where a Graveward stands, mortality becomes inefficient, delayed, and deeply discouraged.</p><p>Gravewards are:</p><ul data-start=\"7198\" data-end=\"7296\"><li data-start=\"7198\" data-end=\"7219\"><p data-start=\"7200\" data-end=\"7219\">Formation anchors</p></li><li data-start=\"7220\" data-end=\"7244\"><p data-start=\"7222\" data-end=\"7244\">Casualty suppressors</p></li><li data-start=\"7245\" data-end=\"7296\"><p data-start=\"7247\" data-end=\"7296\">The reason battles last longer than they should</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"7298\" data-end=\"7375\">They do not promise survival.<br data-start=\"7327\" data-end=\"7330\" />They make death work harder than it wants to.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
